@startuml sequence-officer-json
title Officer pages answer in JSON on the same URL
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "API client\n(Postman, script)" as Client
participant "JsonBodyFilter" as F
participant "Controller\n(unchanged)" as C
participant "Service" as S
participant "JsonResponseInterceptor" as I
participant "GlobalExceptionHandler" as E

== Read: GET with Accept: application/json (or ?format=json) ==
Client -> F : GET /shelters
F -> C : (not a JSON body, passes through)
C -> S : list(...)
S --> C : shelters
C --> I : view "shelters/list" + model
I -> I : client wants JSON: drop form beans and binding results,\nreduce users to id and fullName
I --> Client : 200 application/json {"shelters": [...], "statuses": [...]}

== Action: POST with a JSON body ==
Client -> F : POST /shelters  {"districtId":1,"name":"Town Hall","capacity":30}
F -> F : flat JSON object -> request parameters (arrays become repeated parameters)
alt body is not valid JSON or not an object
  F --> Client : 400 problem+json
else ok
  F -> C : request with parameters (same @Valid binding as the HTML form)
  alt field errors
    C --> I : form view + BindingResult errors
    I --> Client : 400 problem+json {"fieldErrors": {...}}
  else business rule violated (ShelterValidationException)
    C --> I : redirect with flash "error"
    I --> Client : 400 problem+json {"detail": "<rule text>"}
  else success
    C -> S : create(...)
    C --> I : "redirect:/shelters/7" + flash "message"
    I --> Client : 201 Created {"message","location"} + Location header\n(200 for actions on an existing record)
  end
end

== Errors thrown by the controller ==
Client -> C : GET /shelters/999999
C --> E : ResourceNotFoundException
E --> Client : 404 application/problem+json (browsers get the HTML error page)

note over I
  Browsers (Accept contains text/html) and plain form posts
  are not touched. /api/** (mobile contract v1) is excluded.
end note
@enduml
